<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-SWEDEN'S NILSSON SIGNS FOR COVENTRY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDEN'S NILSSON SIGNS FOR COVENTRY.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish veteran defender Roland Nilsson has signed a two-year contract with English premier league side Coventry.</p>
<p>The 34-year-old former Sheffield Wednesday player, who returned to Sweden in 1994, said he would be playing in his usual right-back position for Coventry.</p>
<p>Nilsson, who plays for Sweden's Helsingborg, will link up with compatriot Magnus Hedman at Coventry.</p>
</text>
